  <NAME>Effect of depletion of PRMT3 and IGF2BP1 on gene expression in PLC-8024 cells [PRMT3 IGF2BP1 KD RNA-seq]</NAME>
  <TITLE>Effect of depletion of PRMT3 and IGF2BP1 on gene expression in PLC-8024 cells [PRMT3 IGF2BP1 KD RNA-seq]</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>To investigate the function PRMT3 and IGF2BP1 in HCC, we established PLC-8024 cell lines in which each target gene has been knocked down by shRNA. Overall design: Comparative gene expression profiling analysis of RNA-seq data for PLC-8024 cells and its KD derivatives.</DESCRIPTION>
